content-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974549_1314781348698443_6413088786627952640_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KXQUxcrXeFgQ7kNvwEeLhwX&_nc_oc=AdphHGIMYgUTBEOls7RzPTNfgOUtmxKkwlEsF2jY-F0JHkAHuvn2zzPbjlNvg4zQJGw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx99oNyFVQtkfthBbJ3o6ktIL0oXrY5RZt7Txwj87Engg&oe=69C13340"}, "display_name": "Swords of Gargantua", "keywords": ["action", "coop", "crossplatform", "online", "sword"], "long_description": "SWORDS of GARGANTUA is a cross-platform VR online action game. Fight solo or join up to 3 others in online co-op against a hoard of enemies and their master, the towering titan named GARGANTUA.\n\nKey Features in SWORDS of GARGANTUA:\n\nHyper-Realistic VR Swordsmanship: We\u2019ve taken great care to ensure that each battle feels great through heavy refinement of our battle system and accurate haptic feedback.\n\nCross-Platform 4 Player Co-Op: With native voice chat, develop strategies, revive downed friendlies, and battle hordes of enemies in order to protect your mana station, and penultimately fight an enormous foe.\n\nGrand in Scale: 100 single player missions, 30 weapons to unlock, and a multiplayer mode rarely seen in VR melee action games.\n\nGargantuan in Size: Embrace destiny and take on the mighty titan, Gargantua. Larger and more challenging than anything players have faced in Swords of Gargantua before!", "short_description": "SWORDS of GARGANTUA is a cross-platform VR online action. Fight solo or join up to 3 others in online co-op against a hoard of enemies and their master, the towering titan named GARGANTUA."}]}, "developer_name": "Yomuneco Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.gargantuavr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.gargantuavr.com/eula", "publisher_name": "gumi Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.gargantuavr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tag